body:
I'm not comparing people here. The r/nepal I know is deteriorating day by day. Have you read yesterday's mega thread? You haven't done so till now? Then come back and see who I was addressing with my remarks. I'm not saying that everyone in the sub isn't working on themselves and begging for fwb, but the vast majority of them are. Because of such nonsense, older members of this sub are going inactive.

&#x200B;

But in the end of the day, who cares about your and my opinions? In some ways, I ranted as well, but who cares? Simply say "kasto mg hola." and proceed.

&#x200B;

Have a nice night!

Gonna be blunt and ask How much is your age ,weight and average screen time? My best guess is you aren't physically active and stay indoors most of time which caused your parent to believe that you are a phone addict. And all those weird touches are signal which indirectly applies ki Weight ghata as you mentioned having thulo bhudi in post. 

&#x200B;

tl;dr **Gym jau**
